theme_override_styles/normal = SubResource("StyleBoxFlat_hlod6")
text = "W,D - Move
S -Stick to floor (good for not flying off curved terrain)
Space - Jump (higher the faster you are)
R - restart
Mouse1 - Boost in opposite direction if near a surface

Boost is as strong as your max speed limit allows.
Max speed limit is shown seperately for horizontal and vertical speed (see the spedometers next to the player)
The proximity detector shows you how close you are to surfaces.
Hammer cooldown is shown with the magenta bar.
Mushrooms are boost-pads.




Credit:
Player Sprite, animations, SFX and background art - @Brackeys"

